      "type": "paragraph",
      "isFinalized": true,
      "payload": {
        "raw": "Use an explicit import map containing only the host bindings required by authored imports such as `import { Callout } from \"host:widgets\"`; unresolved imports are not fetched. Trusted evaluation runs in the host realm, requires `unsafe-eval` in the application's `script-src`, and is not a sandbox. Keep untrusted/user-generated content on the restricted path. Pass the trusted engine to `StreamingMarkdown` once; do not separately render a second full MDX module beside the native Markdown tree.",
