      "id": "40e797db",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "isFinalized": true,
      "payload": {
        "raw": "Native worker `FINALIZED` confirms only native semantic completion. Trusted whole-document preparation and evaluation run separately; the trusted document distinguishes requested, projected, and actually rendered revisions. A stale result is rejected after a newer revision or lease/engine invalidation and is checked immediately before authored code runs. Render failure may restore the last committed UI, but it cannot roll back side effects already caused by trusted code.",
